# The generated API clients under generated/ are COMMITTED ON PURPOSE.
# They are regenerated on every contract change (npm run generate) and must
# never be git-ignored, so that a clone builds with no Java runtime and no
# network, and a contract change arrives as a reviewable diff.
# Do NOT add generated/ here.
